(7514687, 1199992, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have loved it if you''d spent a little more time masking windows along the edges of the shot so that the frame is "as is" while the windows reflect the mountain scape. Still, very creative and well done.</td>', 'Would have loved it if you''d spent a little more time masking windows along the edges of the shot so that the frame is "as is" while the windows reflect the mountain scape. Still, very creative and well done.', '2017-05-19 12:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514688, 1199816, 156466, '<td valign="top">You need to spend a little time removing the edges around the wings to make it more convincing. Nicely assembled but not quite finished.</td>', 'You need to spend a little time removing the edges around the wings to make it more convincing. Nicely assembled but not quite finished.', '2017-05-19 12:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514689, 1199777, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not scoring if only because it''s a great piece of graphic art that shows me nothing in terms of photography. Would give it a 1 because of that and the work put in doesn''t deserve that.</td>', 'Not scoring if only because it''s a great piece of graphic art that shows me nothing in terms of photography. Would give it a 1 because of that and the work put in doesn''t deserve that.', '2017-05-19 12:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514693, 1199917, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but as usual I have some nits to pick. Overall feel is dark and flat, which would be OK if it was either or, but this lacks anything at the bright end of the contrast spectrum (all it needs it a simple levels adjustment). The bigger issue is that the cloning/smart filling you did to extend the bottom of the outside image shows repeating lines that are both obvious and very distracting. <br/> <br/>Otherwise I love the painterly quality of this. Giving it a 6 but it could have been 8 or 9 from me.</td>', 'I really like this, but as usual I have some nits to pick. Overall feel is dark and flat, which would be OK if it was either or, but this lacks anything at the bright end of the contrast spectrum (all it needs it a simple levels adjustment). The bigger issue is that the cloning/smart filling you did to extend the bottom of the outside image shows repeating lines that are both obvious and very distracting.  Otherwise I love the painterly quality of this. Giving it a 6 but it could have been 8 or 9 from me.', '2017-05-19 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514694, 1199732, 156466, '<td valign="top">Neat composite, but when you do this you need to be careful for where you go into and out of focus, and there are objects at the bottom that need to be in focus for this to be convincing - and otherwise it is.</td>', 'Neat composite, but when you do this you need to be careful for where you go into and out of focus, and there are objects at the bottom that need to be in focus for this to be convincing - and otherwise it is.', '2017-05-19 12:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514695, 1199994, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting play on perspective</td>', 'Interesting play on perspective', '2017-05-19 12:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514697, 1199925, 156466, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t go for the low contrast, painterly stuff, but this is excellent. If it''s a composite then it''s pretty much flawless, and if it''s not then it''s got enough elements all done really well to make me wonder if it is. My blue for sure. Well done.</td>', 'I generally don''t go for the low contrast, painterly stuff, but this is excellent. If it''s a composite then it''s pretty much flawless, and if it''s not then it''s got enough elements all done really well to make me wonder if it is. My blue for sure. Well done.', '2017-05-19 12:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514752, 1199716, 150202, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my tastes, neat statue.</td>', 'Too dark for my tastes, neat statue.', '2017-05-20 04:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514753, 1199972, 150202, '<td valign="top">Neat composition and structure, the darkness on the edges I find a tad overwhelming for me.</td>', 'Neat composition and structure, the darkness on the edges I find a tad overwhelming for me.', '2017-05-20 04:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514754, 1199947, 150202, '<td valign="top">The background is really neat with the right amount of light. The model being centered and the way the light is too bright on her left but too shadowy on her right I find distracting, not sure of the story either.</td>', 'The background is really neat with the right amount of light. The model being centered and the way the light is too bright on her left but too shadowy on her right I find distracting, not sure of the story either.', '2017-05-20 04:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
